WEBVTT

00:03.166 --> 00:06.062
[light beachy music]
[轻快的海滩音乐]

00:06.131 --> 00:12.993
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:13.062 --> 00:14.235
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

00:14.304 --> 00:15.786
- All right, Plankton.
- 好吧，浮游生物。

00:15.855 --> 00:18.924
I managed to fit 12 changes
of underwear
我成功适应了 12 个变化
内衣的

00:18.993 --> 00:20.890
in your suitcase.
在你的手提箱里。

00:20.959 --> 00:22.441
Will that be enough
for the trip?
这样就够了吗
为了旅行？

00:22.510 --> 00:25.510
- [laughing]
- [barking]
- [笑]
- [吠叫]

00:25.579 --> 00:28.269
- I'm gonna be gone
for three days, Karen,
- 我要走了
三天了，凯伦，

00:28.338 --> 00:30.269
so yeah, that should cover it.
所以是的，这应该涵盖它。

00:30.338 --> 00:31.855
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

00:31.924 --> 00:34.028
That's right, Spot.
Daddy has to go
没错，斯波特。
爸爸必须走了

00:34.097 --> 00:37.786
to the annual Doomsday Device
Expo in Shell City.
每年一度的世界末日装置
贝壳城世博会。

00:37.855 --> 00:40.648
He's gonna find you
an instrument of ultimate evil.
他会找到你的
终极邪恶的工具。

00:40.717 --> 00:42.338
Yes, he is.
是的，他是。

00:42.407 --> 00:44.855
- [barks]
- Don't worry, boy.
- [吠叫]
- 别担心，男孩。

00:44.924 --> 00:47.648
I left lots of instructions
for Mommy,
我留下了很多指示
对于妈妈来说，

00:47.717 --> 00:50.028
so she knows exactly how
to care for you
所以她知道如何
照顾你

00:50.097 --> 00:51.959
while I'm gone.
当我离开的时候。

00:52.028 --> 00:54.338
[bright orchestral music]
[明亮的管弦乐]

00:54.407 --> 00:58.407
My wittle man just needs wots
of extra wove,
我的机智男人只需要wots
额外的编织，

00:58.476 --> 01:00.648
and I would destroy
the whole world
我会摧毁
整个世界

01:00.717 --> 01:03.993
if anything happened to him.
如果他出了什么事。

01:04.062 --> 01:06.166
[horn honks]
- Oh, your taxi's here.
[喇叭鸣响]
- 哦，你的出租车来了。

01:06.235 --> 01:09.752
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:09.821 --> 01:11.235
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

01:12.441 --> 01:15.752
Off you go, Sheldon.
你走吧，谢尔顿。

01:15.821 --> 01:17.717
- So long, Karen.
- 再见，凯伦。

01:17.786 --> 01:20.062
Bye, Spotty!
再见，斯帕蒂！

01:20.131 --> 01:21.235
- Bye, Plankton.
- 再见，浮游生物。

01:21.304 --> 01:22.993
Have a nice trip.
旅行愉快。

01:23.062 --> 01:26.269
Looks like it's just you
and me, Spot.
看来只有你一个人
还有我，斯波特。

01:26.338 --> 01:28.510
Spot?
- [barking]
点？
- [吠叫]

01:28.579 --> 01:29.890
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

01:31.717 --> 01:34.924
Oh, Plankton's instructions.
哦，浮游生物的指示。

01:34.993 --> 01:37.304
Spot, bad amoeba.
现货，坏阿米巴原虫。

01:37.372 --> 01:38.648
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

01:38.717 --> 01:41.372
- Oh, who needs
Plankton's little notes?
- 哦，谁需要
浮游生物的小笔记？

01:41.441 --> 01:45.131
A sophisticated AI like myself
should have no problem
像我这样复杂的人工智能
应该没问题

01:45.200 --> 01:46.993
with a simple organic being.
与一个简单的有机存在。

01:47.062 --> 01:49.545
All he needs
is a basic analysis.
他所需要的一切
是一个基本的分析。

01:49.614 --> 01:51.821
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

01:51.890 --> 01:53.028
[laser humming]
[激光嗡嗡声]

01:53.097 --> 01:54.476
- [chomps]
- No!
- [咀嚼]
- 不！

01:54.545 --> 01:57.614
I'm not done analyzing you.
- [barks]
我还没分析完你呢。
- [吠叫]

01:57.683 --> 01:59.338
- Spot! Heel, boy.
- 点！脚后跟，男孩。

01:59.407 --> 02:01.579
Heel.
- [barks, pants]
脚跟。
- [吠叫，裤子]

02:01.648 --> 02:02.786
[squish]
[挤压]

02:02.855 --> 02:04.200
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

02:04.269 --> 02:06.097
Is he supposed to do that?
他应该这样做吗？

02:06.166 --> 02:09.510
Hmm, maybe he needs
a little pumping up.
嗯，也许他需要
有点泵气。

02:09.579 --> 02:12.476
[light music]
[轻音乐]

02:12.545 --> 02:17.338
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:17.407 --> 02:18.959
- [squeaking]
- [grunts]
- [吱吱声]
- [咕哝]

02:19.028 --> 02:21.890
[straining]
[紧张]

02:21.959 --> 02:24.441
There you go, Spot.
- [barks]
就这样吧，斯波特。
- [吠叫]

02:24.510 --> 02:25.821
[splat]
[啪嗒]

02:25.890 --> 02:26.924
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

02:26.993 --> 02:28.338
I killed him!
我杀了他！

02:28.407 --> 02:29.752
[pounding at door]
[敲门]

02:29.821 --> 02:30.752
Huh?
啊？

02:32.235 --> 02:33.372
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:36.097 --> 02:37.269
Who sent you?
谁派你来的？

02:37.338 --> 02:38.993
What do you know?
你知道什么？

02:39.062 --> 02:40.786
- Hi, Karen.
- 嗨，凯伦。

02:40.855 --> 02:44.269
Gary has a playdate with Spot,
remember?
加里和 Spot 有个约会，
还记得吗？

02:44.338 --> 02:46.235
- Meow.
- 喵。

02:46.304 --> 02:48.476
- Uh, oh, with Spot, huh?
- 呃，哦，用 Spot 吧？

02:48.545 --> 02:50.028
[laughs nervously]
Well, uh, the thing is,
[紧张地笑]
嗯，呃，问题是，

02:50.097 --> 02:52.717
Spot can't play today
because he's, uh--
今天现场无法播放
因为他是，呃——

02:52.786 --> 02:54.752
he--busy. He's busy.
他——忙。他很忙。

02:54.821 --> 02:56.924
He's, uh, very busy, um...
[dial-up beeps]
他，呃，很忙，嗯……
[拨号嘟嘟声]

02:56.993 --> 02:58.614
All over the place in bits
and pieces
到处都是点点滴滴
和碎片

02:58.683 --> 03:02.269
because I exploded him.
因为我把他炸了。

03:02.338 --> 03:07.993
[wailing, crying]
[哀号，哭泣]

03:08.062 --> 03:10.924
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:12.441 --> 03:14.924
Yeah, that's Spot all right.
是的，那就是 Spot。

03:14.993 --> 03:17.510
[laughing]
[笑]

03:17.579 --> 03:19.097
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:19.166 --> 03:22.441
- Spot, come to SpongeBob!
- 现货，来海绵宝宝吧！

03:22.510 --> 03:24.200
[whistles]
[口哨声]

03:24.269 --> 03:27.200
[cheery music]
[欢快的音乐]

03:27.269 --> 03:28.441
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:28.510 --> 03:31.924
- How did you figure that out?
- 你是怎么想出来的？

03:31.993 --> 03:34.441
- This happens all the time
when he plays with Gary.
- 这种情况经常发生
当他和加里一起玩的时候。

03:34.510 --> 03:35.821
- [squeals]
- [grunts]
- [尖叫声]
- [咕哝]

03:35.890 --> 03:37.200
- [squeals]
- Meow.
- [尖叫声]
- 喵。

03:37.269 --> 03:40.166
- Oh, I admit,
looking after Spot
- 哦，我承认，
照顾现货

03:40.235 --> 03:42.372
while Plankton is gone
is proving trickier
当浮游生物消失时
事实证明更棘手

03:42.441 --> 03:43.372
than I thought.
比我想象的要多。

03:43.441 --> 03:46.062
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:46.131 --> 03:48.097
[crunch]
[紧缩]

03:48.166 --> 03:49.372
- Whoo!
- 呼！

03:49.441 --> 03:51.683
[squealing]
[尖叫声]

03:51.752 --> 03:54.131
- Maybe he needs
to burn off some energy?
- 也许他需要
消耗一些能量？

03:56.028 --> 03:57.683
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:57.752 --> 04:00.338
How are you so strong?
你怎么这么强？

04:00.407 --> 04:04.166
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:04.235 --> 04:06.855
[sighs]
- [barks]
[叹气]
- [吠叫]

04:06.924 --> 04:08.166
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

04:08.235 --> 04:10.890
[purrs]
[呼噜声]

04:10.959 --> 04:13.200
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

04:13.269 --> 04:14.545
[belches]
[打嗝]

04:14.614 --> 04:17.028
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

04:17.097 --> 04:18.855
- Meow?
- 喵？

04:20.372 --> 04:21.959
[brakes screeching]
[刹车声]

04:23.752 --> 04:26.235
- Spot, look at this mess.
- 斑点，看看这烂摊子。

04:26.304 --> 04:27.579
- Come on, Spot.
- 来吧，斯波特。

04:27.648 --> 04:29.924
Don't you want
to be a good boy like Gary?
难道你不想
做一个像Gary一样的好孩子？

04:29.993 --> 04:31.786
[siren blares]
- [growls]
[警笛声]
- [咆哮]

04:33.166 --> 04:35.476
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

04:35.545 --> 04:37.993
[barking]
- Spot, no!
[吠叫]
- 现货，不！

04:38.062 --> 04:39.717
Bad boy.
坏男孩。

04:42.683 --> 04:44.614
- Whoa!
- [barking]
- 哇！
- [吠叫]

04:44.683 --> 04:48.131
- [sobbing]
- [gasps]
- [抽泣]
- [喘气]

04:48.200 --> 04:50.304
- Whoa!
- 哇！

04:50.372 --> 04:51.717
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

04:51.786 --> 04:55.131
- I nose this ain't my donut.
- 我嗅到这不是我的甜甜圈。

04:55.200 --> 04:56.304
- Oh.
- 哦。

04:56.372 --> 04:58.304
[chokes]
[窒息]

04:58.372 --> 05:00.304
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

05:00.372 --> 05:01.855
- He's too fast.
- 他太快了。

05:01.924 --> 05:03.407
How can this get any worse?
这怎么会变得更糟呢？

05:03.476 --> 05:06.235
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

05:06.304 --> 05:08.786
- Karen's head,
how may I direct your call?
- 凯伦的头，
我该如何转接您的电话？

05:08.855 --> 05:10.890
- Oh, yes.
May I talk to Karen?
- 哦是的。
我可以和凯伦谈谈吗？

05:10.959 --> 05:13.131
Wait a minute. Who is this?
等一下。这是谁？

05:13.200 --> 05:15.648
- Uh, uh, that was me...
[laughs]
- 呃，呃，那是我……
[笑]

05:15.717 --> 05:18.235
Throwing my voice,
and now it's you.
发出我的声音，
现在是你了。

05:18.304 --> 05:20.304
How's the Doomsday Expo?
末日博览会怎么样？

05:20.372 --> 05:21.786
- Oh, it's over.
- 哦，结束了。

05:21.855 --> 05:24.166
I'm coming home early.
- You're what?
我要早点回家
- 你是什么？

05:24.235 --> 05:27.200
- But I bought the most evil
world-conquering device
- 但我买了最邪恶的
征服世界的装置

05:27.269 --> 05:28.372
I could find.
我能找到。

05:28.441 --> 05:31.614
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

05:31.683 --> 05:34.166
Anyway, how's my little Spot?
无论如何，我的小斑点怎么样？

05:34.235 --> 05:35.131
Put him on the phone.
让他接电话。

05:35.200 --> 05:36.269
I miss his voice.
我想念他的声音。

05:36.338 --> 05:37.959
- Put Spot on the phone?
- Whoa.
- 在手机上安装 Spot 吗？
- 哇哦。

05:38.028 --> 05:39.441
This phone?
- [whimpers]
这个电话？
- [呜咽]

05:39.510 --> 05:42.131
Ooh.
哦。

05:45.131 --> 05:46.717
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

05:46.786 --> 05:49.235
- There's my wittle man.
- 这是我的机智人。

05:49.304 --> 05:52.028
Sounds like Mommy is taking
good care of you.
听起来妈妈正在服用
照顾好你。

05:52.097 --> 05:55.372
- Hey, some idiot left
this tiny suitcase
- 嘿，剩下一些白痴
这个小手提箱

05:55.441 --> 05:57.304
next to an open flame!
旁边有明火！

05:57.372 --> 05:59.510
[explosions]
Oh, no.
[爆炸]
哦，不。

05:59.579 --> 06:02.510
[everyone screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

06:02.579 --> 06:05.407
- Uh, gotta go.
- 呃，该走了。

06:05.476 --> 06:08.372
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

06:08.441 --> 06:09.959
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:10.028 --> 06:12.614
[bell dings]
[铃声]

06:12.683 --> 06:14.269
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:16.924 --> 06:20.993
Whew, let's get back
before Plankton comes home.
哇，我们回去吧
在浮游生物回家之前。

06:21.062 --> 06:22.855
- Meow.
- Oh, hey, Gary.
- 喵。
- 哦，嘿，加里。

06:22.924 --> 06:25.062
How was your shift?
- Meow.
你的轮班怎么样？
- 喵。

06:27.200 --> 06:30.062
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

06:30.924 --> 06:32.510
- What's wrong?
- 怎么了？

06:32.579 --> 06:34.545
You haven't touched your chum.
你还没有碰过你的密友。

06:34.614 --> 06:35.821
- No, thank you.
- 不，谢谢。

06:35.890 --> 06:37.924
I don't really eat chum.
我真的不吃密友。

06:37.993 --> 06:40.752
- Yep, me neither.
- 是的，我也一样。

06:40.821 --> 06:42.407
- [growling, barking]
- [咆哮，吠叫]

06:42.476 --> 06:45.131
- Karen? Have you fed Spot yet?
- 凯伦？你喂Spot了吗？

06:45.200 --> 06:48.959
- No, does he not consume
power from his battery?
- 不，他不消费吗
从他的电池供电？

06:49.028 --> 06:50.304
- Uh, no.
- 呃，不。

06:50.372 --> 06:54.200
He consumes other stuff.
他消耗其他东西。

06:55.200 --> 06:56.717
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

06:59.752 --> 07:01.683
[barks]
[吠叫]

07:01.752 --> 07:03.683
- Are you still hungry?
- [barks]
- 你还饿吗？
- [吠叫]

07:03.752 --> 07:08.821
- Okay, how 'bout a nice, um,
a napkin dispenser?
- 好吧，怎么样，嗯，
餐巾纸分配器？

07:10.717 --> 07:12.924
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

07:12.993 --> 07:15.097
- Gee, Spot'll eat anything,
huh?
- 哎呀，Spot什么都吃，
嗯？

07:19.545 --> 07:22.131
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

07:22.200 --> 07:25.614
- [gasps, growls]
No more, Spot.
- [喘气，咆哮]
不用了，斯波特。

07:25.683 --> 07:28.614
You literally just ate us
out of house and home.
你简直把我们吃了
出家门和家。

07:28.683 --> 07:30.924
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

07:30.993 --> 07:33.131
- Fine, you're still hungry?
- 好吧，你还饿吗？

07:33.200 --> 07:34.855
I'll give you all
the nourishment
我会给你一切
营养

07:34.924 --> 07:37.200
you'll ever need.
你永远需要。

07:41.441 --> 07:45.200
Here, I synthesized
a perpetual nutrient pill.
这里我综合一下
永久营养丸。

07:45.269 --> 07:47.752
It'll keep feeding you
so you'll be full.
它会一直喂你
这样你就会吃饱了。

07:47.821 --> 07:50.614
Forever.
永远。

07:50.683 --> 07:52.476
Huh? Uh--
啊？呃——

07:52.545 --> 07:53.786
- Hey, Karen?
- 嘿，凯伦？

07:53.855 --> 07:56.166
Is he supposed
to be getting bigger?
他是否应该
变得更大？

07:56.235 --> 07:59.062
- That was not
in my calculations.
- 那不是
在我的计算中。

07:59.131 --> 08:01.338
- It's gonna stop soon? Right?
- Meow.
- 很快就会停止吗？正确的？
- 喵。

08:01.407 --> 08:03.131
- Uh, well,
you see, SpongeBob,
- 呃，好吧，
你看，海绵宝宝，

08:03.200 --> 08:05.683
I didn't program the pill
to stop.
我没有对药丸进行编程
停止。

08:05.752 --> 08:06.683
Ever.
曾经。

08:06.752 --> 08:08.269
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

08:10.855 --> 08:13.476
- I gotta be careful with you.
[laughs]
- 我得小心你。
[笑]

08:13.545 --> 08:16.579
One wrong move and you'll blow
the whole ocean sky-high.
一个错误的举动就会让你大吃一惊
整个海洋高耸入云。

08:16.648 --> 08:18.028
[laughs]
[笑]

08:18.097 --> 08:20.269
Huh?
啊？

08:20.338 --> 08:22.752
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

08:23.786 --> 08:26.959
Huh, the good times never last.
呵呵，美好的时光永远不会长久。

08:27.028 --> 08:29.545
Aah!
啊啊！

08:29.614 --> 08:31.304
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:31.372 --> 08:33.131
[boom]
- Ouch!
[轰]
- 哎呀！

08:33.200 --> 08:37.614
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:37.683 --> 08:39.338
- [gasps]
- Huh?
- [喘气]
- 啊？

08:39.407 --> 08:42.441
[citizens murmuring]
[市民窃窃私语]

08:44.648 --> 08:47.200
- Karen!
- 凯伦！

08:47.269 --> 08:49.407
- [grunts]
- None of my sticky notes said
- [咕哝]
- 我的便利贴都没有说

08:49.476 --> 08:51.717
to turn Spot into a behemoth!
将 Spot 变成庞然大物！

08:51.786 --> 08:53.786
- Well,
this wouldn't have happened
- 嗯，
这不会发生

08:53.855 --> 08:56.855
if you had trained him
properly.
如果你训练过他
正确地。

08:56.924 --> 08:58.890
- I'm a busy man.
- 我是个大忙人。

08:58.959 --> 09:01.648
You should've been following
my instructions.
你应该一直在关注
我的指示。

09:01.717 --> 09:04.097
- Excuse me?
- 打扰一下？

09:04.166 --> 09:09.166
I am your computer wife,
not your computer maid.
我是你的电脑老婆
不是你的电脑女仆。

09:09.235 --> 09:11.028
- [whining]
- I slave all day
- [抱怨]
- 我整天都在做奴隶

09:11.097 --> 09:12.890
over a hot keyboard--
- Oh, so everything
在热键盘上——
- 哦，所以一切

09:12.959 --> 09:14.200
is my fault!
是我的错！

09:14.269 --> 09:16.304
It's all ones and zeroes
with you, honey.
都是一和零
和你在一起，亲爱的。

09:16.372 --> 09:19.614
You probably made Spot bigger
than me on purpose...
你可能让 Spot 变得更大
故意比我...

09:19.683 --> 09:21.269
- Aha!
- To make me feel small.
- 啊哈！
- 让我感觉自己很渺小。

09:21.338 --> 09:23.097
- Spot?
- Your mouth is the biggest
- 点？
- 你的嘴是最大的

09:23.166 --> 09:25.235
part of you--
- Ah!
你的一部分——
- 啊！

09:25.304 --> 09:26.993
- Everything about you
is small.
- 关于你的一切
很小。

09:27.062 --> 09:28.959
- My heart is big.
- 我的心很大。

09:29.028 --> 09:30.752
- [straining]
- I should not have settled.
- [紧张]
- 我不应该安顿下来。

09:30.821 --> 09:32.855
- Look!
both: Huh?
- 看！
两人：啊？

09:32.924 --> 09:33.821
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

09:33.890 --> 09:35.131
- Spot!
- 点！

09:35.200 --> 09:37.959
I think he's dividing.
我认为他正在分裂。

09:38.028 --> 09:41.269
- Aww, he doesn't like it
when Mommy and Daddy fight.
- 哇哦，他不喜欢
当妈妈和爸爸吵架的时候。

09:41.338 --> 09:43.821
Come on, boy. Come to Papa.
- [groaning]
来吧，男孩。来找爸爸吧。
- [呻吟]

09:43.890 --> 09:45.786
- Come on, boy!
- Come to Daddy.
- 来吧，孩子！
- 到爸爸那里来。

09:45.855 --> 09:47.752
- Come on!
- [groaning]
- 快点！
- [呻吟]

09:47.821 --> 09:49.200
[snap]
[折断]

09:49.269 --> 09:50.786
all: Spot!
全体：现货！

09:50.855 --> 09:52.269
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:52.338 --> 09:54.304
Aww. [laughs]
哇。 [笑]

09:54.372 --> 09:57.855
Aww.
- Oh, I can't stay mad
哇。
- 哦，我不能继续生气

09:57.924 --> 10:00.648
at these cute little faces.
看着这些可爱的小脸。

10:00.717 --> 10:02.855
- Well,
I'm still a little mad.
- 嗯，
我还是有点生气。

10:02.924 --> 10:04.579
[both laugh]
- Aww.
[两人都笑了]
- 哇。

10:04.648 --> 10:07.304
- [chomps]
- [laughing]
- [咀嚼]
- [笑]

10:07.372 --> 10:10.269
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

10:10.338 --> 10:12.545
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:12.614 --> 10:15.510
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

10:19.097 --> 10:22.200
[light beachy music]
[轻快的海滩音乐]

10:22.269 --> 10:29.269
